"Debit cards are most likely to be accepted." = "Il-karti tad-debitu huma l-aktar probabbli li jiġu aċċettati.";

"Document uploaded successfully" = "Dokument ittella' b'suċċess";

"Please try again later." = "Jekk jogħġbok erġa’ pprova aktar tard.";

"Submitted for review" = "Sottomess għar-reviżjoni";

"Tell us about your source of funds" = "Għidilna dwar is-sors tal-fondi tiegħek";

"This app couldn't be verified due to an attestation error. Please try again later or contact the developer if the issue persists." = "Din l-app ma setgħetx tiġi vverifikata minħabba żball ta’ attestazzjoni. Jekk jogħġbok erġa’ pprova aktar tard jew ikkuntattja lill-iżviluppatur jekk il-problema tibqa’.";

"This app couldn't be verified. Contact the app developer for help." = "Din l-app ma setgħetx tiġi vverifikata. Ikkuntattja lill-iżviluppatur tal-app għall-għajnuna.";

"This wallet couldn't be found. Please choose or add a wallet and try again." = "Din il-kartiera ma setgħetx tinstab. Jekk jogħġbok agħżel jew żid kartiera u erġa' pprova.";

"This wallet network isn't supported. Please choose a different network." = "In-network ta' din il-kartiera mhuwiex appoġġjat. Jekk jogħġbok agħżel network differenti.";

"This wallet verification request expired. Please try again." = "Din it-talba għal verifika tal-kartiera skadiet. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' pprova.";

"This wallet verification request is invalid. Please try again." = "Din it-talba ta' verifika tal-kartiera hija invalida. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' pprova.";

"Upload your proof of address" = "Tella' l-prova tal-indirizz tiegħek";

"We couldn't verify ownership of this wallet. Please try again." = "Ma stajniex nivverifikaw is-sjieda ta' din il-kartiera. Jekk jogħġbok erġa' pprova.";

"We may request proof of address for larger transactions." = "Jaf nitolbu prova tal-indirizz għal tranżazzjonijiet akbar.";

"We may request source of funds for larger transactions." = "Jaf nitolbu sors ta' fondi għal tranżazzjonijiet akbar.";

"We’re reviewing your documents. We’ll let you know when verification is complete." = "Qegħdin nirrevedu d-dokumenti tiegħek. Se ninfurmawk meta titlesta l-verifika.";

"You can continue while we verify your document in the background." = "Tista' tkompli waqt li nivverifikaw id-dokument tiegħek fl-isfond.";
